lxcfreeze: LXC is not installed on this host — missing: lxc-info lxc-freeze lxc-unfreeze
  This is not 'no containers': nothing here can answer the question at all.
  LXC is declared in playbooks/imports/play-lxc-install-config.yml, which
  playbook-main.yml imports. Deploy it with:
    ansible-playbook playbooks/imports/play-lxc-install-config.yml
  Do NOT install it by hand.
